§§ `DECIDED-ANSWERS section 2 — the same cells read branch by branch, for a person who pays the branch`

-- Section 2's dash rule: a dash in the person's column, for a branch the person pays, is a refusal.
-- Items 1 and 2 are both maternity and never both print a figure in one column, so the branch
-- reads whichever of the two prints one.
