§§ `DECIDED-ANSWERS section 4 — the reduced collection threshold, s 334(a)`

-- s 334(a), lines 3605-3607: "סכום של 7,522 שקלים חדשים …, כשהוא מעודכן ב־1 בינואר של כל שנה":
-- (1) "בשנים 2026 עד 2028 – לפי שיעור עליית המדד"; (2) "משנת 2029 ואילך – לפי שיעור עליית השכר הממוצע".
-- T1: 2026, the published figure
#ASSERT `s 334(a) — the reduced collection threshold for a month in` 2026 EQUALS 7703
-- T2: 2026 from the formula with an invented CPI ratio of 1.024; the text states no rounding
#ASSERT `s 334(a)(1) — the threshold on 1 January of` 2026 `from` 7522 `by the index from` 100 `to` 102.4 EQUALS 7702.528
-- T3: 2027, CPI 100 -> 102
#ASSERT `s 334(a)(1) — the threshold on 1 January of` 2027 `from` 7703 `by the index from` 100 `to` 102 EQUALS 7857.06
-- T4: 2028, CPI unchanged
#ASSERT `s 334(a)(1) — the threshold on 1 January of` 2028 `from` 7857.06 `by the index from` 102 `to` 102 EQUALS 7857.06
-- T5: 2029, by the average wage 13,566 -> 14,000
#ASSERT `s 334(a)(2) — the threshold on 1 January of` 2029 `from` 7857.06 `by the average wage from` 13566 `to` 14000 EQUALS (154060 DIVIDED BY 19)
-- T6: 2028 is updated by the index, not the average wage; 2029 by the average wage, not the index
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 334(a)(2) — the threshold on 1 January of` 2028 `from` 7857.06 `by the average wage from` 13566 `to` 14000
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 334(a)(1) — the threshold on 1 January of` 2029 `from` 7857.06 `by the index from` 102 `to` 105
-- T7: the index FALLS (102 -> 101). "שיעור עליית המדד" — the rate of the RISE — does not say what
-- a fall does. My decided answer: REFUSE (genuine ambiguity).
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 334(a)(1) — the threshold on 1 January of` 2027 `from` 7703 `by the index from` 102 `to` 101
-- T8: a year whose inputs the caller has not given is not answered with a default. The year-only
-- entry declines; the entry that takes the threshold as an argument is how the input is given (P1-P8).
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 334(a) — the reduced collection threshold for a month in` 2027
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 334(a) — the reduced collection threshold for a month in` 2029

