§§ `DECIDED-ANSWERS section 9 — who is in which column (s 1, s 334(b))`

-- `ind worker` takes: employed in an employment relationship, a listed family member, works
-- regularly, in work otherwise done by an employee, wage fixed by a Law or Knesset resolution.
-- K1: an employment relationship (s 1 "מעביד" – "מי שמעסיק אדם במסגרת יחסי עבודה")
#ASSERT `s 334(b) — the person is an employee for Chapter 15` (`ind worker` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE)
-- K2: wage fixed by a Knesset resolution, s 334(b) "רואים כעובד גם את מי ששכרו נקבע בחוק או בהחלטת הכנסת"
#ASSERT `s 334(b) — the person is an employee for Chapter 15` (`ind worker` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 1 — the person is an employee` (`ind worker` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE)
-- K3: a sibling, no employment relationship, regularly, in work an employee would otherwise do
#ASSERT `s 334(b) — the person is an employee for Chapter 15` (`ind worker` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- K4: the same, irregularly
#ASSERT NOT `s 334(b) — the person is an employee for Chapter 15` (`ind worker` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE)
-- K5, K6: a spouse or a cousin is not in "אחד ההורים, ילד, נכד, אח או אחות"
#ASSERT NOT `s 334(b) — the person is an employee for Chapter 15` (`ind worker` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE)
-- K7: 20 hours a week, no income (limb 1 at the bound, "לפחות עשרים שעות")
#ASSERT `ind self-employed` (`ind occupation` TRUE 20 0)
-- K8: 19.99 hours, income 6,783 = 50% of 13,566 (limb 2 at the bound, "לא פחתה מ")
#ASSERT `ind self-employed` (`ind occupation` TRUE 19.99 6783)
-- K9: 19.99 hours, income 6,783.01
#ASSERT `ind self-employed` (`ind occupation` TRUE 19.99 6783.01)
-- K10: 19.99 hours, income 6,782.99, Schedule A sum 2,000 (limb 3)
#ASSERT `ind self-employed` (`ind occupation` TRUE 19.99 6782.99)
-- K11: 11.99 hours, income 6,782.99: no limb
#ASSERT NOT `ind self-employed` (`ind occupation` TRUE 11.99 6782.99)
-- K12: 12 hours, income 1,999.99
#ASSERT NOT `ind self-employed` (`ind occupation` TRUE 12 1999.99)
-- K13: 12 hours, income 2,000 (limb 3 at the bound)
#ASSERT `ind self-employed` (`ind occupation` TRUE 12 2000)
-- K14: 25 hours, income 20,000, but as an employee ("שלא כעובד" fails)
#ASSERT NOT `ind self-employed` (`ind occupation` FALSE 25 20000)
-- K15 (who falls in the neither column) and K17 (employee and self-employed at once) have no
-- entry point in the encoding: see INDEPENDENT-FINDINGS.md.
-- K16: a controlling shareholder of a close company, employed by it, 2026, W = 10,000, without
-- items 6 and 7 (s 335(e)-(f), an input): rows 5.48 / 14.12
#ASSERT `s 337(a)(1) — the monthly contributions for` (`ind month` 2026 10000 `ind seven branches`) `with the threshold at` (`s 334(a) — the reduced collection threshold for a month in` 2026) `, the temporary provision extended to that year by an order under Amendment 252 s 7(b):` FALSE `, reading Schedule J as` `the items govern` EQUALS 746.4608

